.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Logs
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# E2E scratch — captured ids and, worse, captured JWTs. Two signed instructor
# and student tokens were found COMMITTED here (2026-08-10); a token in the repo
# is a credential in the repo, whether or not it has since expired. These are
# the shapes the harness writes: *tok.txt holds a token, aid_* an assignment id.
*tok.txt
aid_*.txt
e2e-*.mjs
e2e-*.cjs

